    <item><headword id="d0e90" type="heading" level="h1">2. A’ mathachadh no a’ leasachadh na talmhainn</headword></item>
    <item><headword id="d0e94" type="heading" level="h1">3. A’ treabhadh no a’ ruamhar: an crann agus ainm gach pàirt dheth</headword></item>
    <item><headword id="d0e98" type="heading" level="h1">4. Innealan beaga leithid spaid, gràp, ràcan is mar sin</headword></item>
    <item><headword id="d0e102" type="heading" level="h1">5. Acfhuinn an eich airson gach seòrsa obair</headword></item>
    <item><headword id="d0e106" type="heading" level="h1">6. A’ cur an t-sìl</headword></item>
    <item><headword id="d0e110" type="heading" level="h1">7. A’ buain agus a’ tiormachadh an arbhair no an fheòir</headword></item>
    <item><headword id="d0e114" type="heading" level="h1">8. A’ togail a’ bhuntàta</headword></item>
    <item><headword id="d0e118" type="heading" level="h1">9. A’ tasgadh an arbhair agus a’ bhuntàta</headword></item>
    <item><headword id="d0e122" type="heading" level="h1">10. A’ bualadh ’s a’ criathradh</headword></item>
    <item><headword id="d0e126" type="heading" level="h1">11. A’ bleith an t-sìl</headword></item>
    <item><headword id="d0e130" type="heading" level="h1">12. Ainmean a chleachdar ri earrainn fearainn</headword></item>
    <item><headword id="d0e134" type="heading" level="h1">13. Faclan sam bith eile</headword></item>
  </items>
